@@ -0,0 +1,33 @@
+# Saleor Commerce
+
+Saleor Commerce manages catalog, customer, checkout, and order concepts for the Saleor platform.
+
+## Age-Gated Sales
+
+**Age-restricted Product**:
+A Product marked as requiring a Customer to meet the site's minimum purchase age before it can be bought. The restriction applies to every ProductVariant of that Product.
+_Avoid_: Age-gated variant
+
+**Minimum purchase age**:
+The single site-wide age threshold used to determine eligibility for every age-restricted Product.
+_Avoid_: Product minimum age, regional age limit
+
+**Date of birth**:
+The Customer's self-declared calendar date of birth, used to determine eligibility for age-restricted Products. It is personal data and is not identity verification.
+_Avoid_: Birthday, age verification
+
+**Age eligibility**:
+Whether a Customer's date of birth meets the minimum purchase age on the current date in the shop's timezone.
+_Avoid_: Age-verified customer
+
+**Age eligibility flag**:
+A derived yes/no value indicating a Customer's age eligibility, available to the Customer and staff with Customer-management permission. It does not disclose the Customer's date of birth.
+
+**Unlinked staff draft order**:
+A staff-created draft order that has no Customer attached. It may be completed with an age-restricted Product because no Customer date of birth is available to evaluate.
+
+**Customer-management staff**:
+A staff member with Customer-management permission who may view a Customer's age eligibility flag but not their date of birth.
+
+**Age-restriction label**:
+The public label showing the current minimum purchase age on an age-restricted Product.
